  "plot": "After several unsuccessful marital mediation sessions and fruitless attempts to make it work, Charlie, a talented theatre director from New York City, and Nicole, a former movie actress from Los Angeles, want to call it quits. However, divorce is never easy, especially after ten years of marriage and an eight-year-old boy. As slick and absurdly costly lawyers step in, mutual accusations and bitter resentment threaten an amicable separation. And now, things have got even messier. But why do the painful wounds of passion run so deep? Is love always meant to last forever in the end?",
